 the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nNaira went to the school theatre to watch the Lion King recital brought by the school's theatre club. Little did she know that Harry, her close friend, was the actor for Simba, who was under heavy makeup for his role. Once the performance was over, there was a chance for some selected audience to meet the performers backstage, Naira being one of them. Naira told the crew that apart from Simba's performance, she enjoyed the show a lot.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Harry ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Fear\nB) Joy\nC) Remorse\nD) Anticipation\nE) Gratitude\nF) Embarrassment\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Harry feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) Naira didn't recognize him in his makeup\nB) His performance was the only part of the show his close friend didn't like\nC) Naira didn't get the chance to meet him backstage\nD) His friend showed up and supported his performance","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014063624563840032,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6ce9aa9dc5a833d9a97","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483918517,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"cb982bff4d86469a8400b3287a579f02"}